{"page":122,"verses":[{"verse_key":"5:84","surah":5,"ayah":84,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَا لَنَا لَا نُؤْمِنُ بِٱللَّهِ وَمَا جَآءَنَا مِنَ ٱلْحَقِّ وَنَطْمَعُ أَن يُدْخِلَنَا رَبُّنَا مَعَ ٱلْقَوْمِ ٱلصَّـٰلِحِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Why should we not believe in God and in the Truth that has come down to us, when we long for our Lord to include us in the company of the righteous?’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"5:84"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَنَا","en_gloss":"for us (that)","transliteration":"lanā","verse_key":"5:84"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"5:84"},{"pos":4,"ar":"نُؤْمِنُ","en_gloss":"we believe","transliteration":"nu'minu","verse_key":"5:84"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"in Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"5:84"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"5:84"},{"pos":7,"ar":"جَآءَنَا","en_gloss":"came (to) us","transliteration":"jāanā","verse_key":"5:84"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"5:84"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْحَقِّ","en_gloss":"the truth","transliteration":"l-ḥaqi","verse_key":"5:84"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَنَطْمَعُ","en_gloss":"And we hope","transliteration":"wanaṭmaʿu","verse_key":"5:84"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"5:84"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يُدْخِلَنَا","en_gloss":"will admit us","transliteration":"yud'khilanā","verse_key":"5:84"},{"pos":13,"ar":"رَبُّنَا","en_gloss":"our Lord","transliteration":"rabbunā","verse_key":"5:84"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مَعَ","en_gloss":"with","transliteration":"maʿa","verse_key":"5:84"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْقَوْمِ","en_gloss":"the people","transliteration":"l-qawmi","verse_key":"5:84"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحِينَ","en_gloss":"the righteous","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥīna","verse_key":"5:84"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٨٤","en_gloss":"(84)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"5:84"}]},{"verse_key":"5:85","surah":5,"ayah":85,"ar_uthmani":"فَأَثَـٰبَهُمُ ٱللَّهُ بِمَا قَالُوا۟ جَنَّـٰتٍ تَجْرِى مِن تَحْتِهَا ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ خَـٰلِدِينَ فِيهَا ۚ وَذَٰلِكَ جَزَآءُ ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"For saying this, God has rewarded them with Gardens graced with flowing streams, and there they will stay: that is the reward of those who do good.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَأَثَـٰبَهُمُ","en_gloss":"So rewarded them","transliteration":"fa-athābahumu","verse_key":"5:85"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"5:85"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"for what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"5:85"},{"pos":4,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"they said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"5:85"},{"pos":5,"ar":"جَنَّـٰتٍۢ","en_gloss":"(with) Gardens","transliteration":"jannātin","verse_key":"5:85"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تَجْرِى","en_gloss":"flows","transliteration":"tajrī","verse_key":"5:85"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"5:85"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تَحْتِهَا","en_gloss":"underneath them","transliteration":"taḥtihā","verse_key":"5:85"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ","en_gloss":"the rivers","transliteration":"l-anhāru","verse_key":"5:85"},{"pos":10,"ar":"خَـٰلِدِينَ","en_gloss":"will abide forever","transliteration":"khālidīna","verse_key":"5:85"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فِيهَا ۚ","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"5:85"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"And that","transliteration":"wadhālika","verse_key":"5:85"},{"pos":13,"ar":"جَزَآءُ","en_gloss":"(is the) reward","transliteration":"jazāu","verse_key":"5:85"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) the good-doers","transliteration":"l-muḥ'sinīna","verse_key":"5:85"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٨٥","en_gloss":"(85)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"5:85"}]},{"verse_key":"5:86","surah":5,"ayah":86,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ وَكَذَّبُوا۟ بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَآ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ أَصْحَـٰبُ ٱلْجَحِيمِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Those who reject the truth and deny Our messages will be the inhabitants of Hellfire.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"And those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"5:86"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieved","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"5:86"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَكَذَّبُوا۟","en_gloss":"and denied","transliteration":"wakadhabū","verse_key":"5:86"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَآ","en_gloss":"Our Signs","transliteration":"biāyātinā","verse_key":"5:86"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"those","transliteration":"ulāika","verse_key":"5:86"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَصْحَـٰبُ","en_gloss":"(are the) companions","transliteration":"aṣḥābu","verse_key":"5:86"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْجَحِيمِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Hellfire","transliteration":"l-jaḥīmi","verse_key":"5:86"},{"pos":8,"ar":"٨٦","en_gloss":"(86)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"5:86"}]},{"verse_key":"5:87","surah":5,"ayah":87,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ لَا تُحَرِّمُوا۟ طَيِّبَـٰتِ مَآ أَحَلَّ ٱللَّهُ لَكُمْ وَلَا تَعْتَدُوٓا۟ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ لَا يُحِبُّ ٱلْمُعْتَدِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"You who believe, do not forbid the good things God has made lawful to you- do not exceed the limits: God does not love those who exceed the limits-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O you","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"5:87"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"5:87"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"5:87"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(Do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"5:87"},{"pos":5,"ar":"تُحَرِّمُوا۟","en_gloss":"make unlawful","transliteration":"tuḥarrimū","verse_key":"5:87"},{"pos":6,"ar":"طَيِّبَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"(the) good things","transliteration":"ṭayyibāti","verse_key":"5:87"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَآ","en_gloss":"(of) what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"5:87"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَحَلَّ","en_gloss":"has (been) made lawful","transliteration":"aḥalla","verse_key":"5:87"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"(by) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"5:87"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَكُمْ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"5:87"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"5:87"},{"pos":12,"ar":"تَعْتَدُوٓا۟ ۚ","en_gloss":"transgress","transliteration":"taʿtadū","verse_key":"5:87"},{"pos":13,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"5:87"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"5:87"},{"pos":15,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(does) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"5:87"},{"pos":16,"ar":"يُحِبُّ","en_gloss":"love","transliteration":"yuḥibbu","verse_key":"5:87"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱلْمُعْتَدِينَ","en_gloss":"the transgressors","transliteration":"l-muʿ'tadīna","verse_key":"5:87"},{"pos":18,"ar":"٨٧","en_gloss":"(87)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"5:87"}]},{"verse_key":"5:88","surah":5,"ayah":88,"ar_uthmani":"وَكُلُوا۟ مِمَّا رَزَقَكُمُ ٱللَّهُ حَلَـٰلًا طَيِّبًا ۚ وَٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ ٱلَّذِىٓ أَنتُم بِهِۦ مُؤْمِنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"but eat the lawful and good things that God provides for you. Be mindful of God, in whom you believe.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَكُلُوا۟","en_gloss":"And eat","transliteration":"wakulū","verse_key":"5:88"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مِمَّا","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"mimmā","verse_key":"5:88"},{"pos":3,"ar":"رَزَقَكُمُ","en_gloss":"has provided you","transliteration":"razaqakumu","verse_key":"5:88"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah ","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"5:88"},{"pos":5,"ar":"حَلَـٰلًۭا","en_gloss":"lawful","transliteration":"ḥalālan","verse_key":"5:88"},{"pos":6,"ar":"طَيِّبًۭا ۚ","en_gloss":"good","transliteration":"ṭayyiban","verse_key":"5:88"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَٱتَّقُوا۟","en_gloss":"And fear","transliteration":"wa-ittaqū","verse_key":"5:88"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"5:88"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","en_gloss":"the One","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"5:88"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَنتُم","en_gloss":"you (are)","transliteration":"antum","verse_key":"5:88"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"in Him","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"5:88"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"believers","transliteration":"mu'minūna","verse_key":"5:88"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٨٨","en_gloss":"(88)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"5:88"}]},{"verse_key":"5:89","surah":5,"ayah":89,"ar_uthmani":"لَا يُؤَاخِذُكُمُ ٱللَّهُ بِٱللَّغْوِ فِىٓ أَيْمَـٰنِكُمْ وَلَـٰكِن يُؤَاخِذُكُم بِمَا عَقَّدتُّمُ ٱلْأَيْمَـٰنَ ۖ فَكَفَّـٰرَتُهُۥٓ إِطْعَامُ عَشَرَةِ مَسَـٰكِينَ مِنْ أَوْسَطِ مَا تُطْعِمُونَ أَهْلِيكُمْ أَوْ كِسْوَتُهُمْ أَوْ تَحْرِيرُ رَقَبَةٍ ۖ فَمَن لَّمْ يَجِدْ فَصِيَامُ ثَلَـٰثَةِ أَيَّامٍ ۚ ذَٰلِكَ كَفَّـٰرَةُ أَيْمَـٰنِكُمْ إِذَا حَلَفْتُمْ ۚ وَٱحْفَظُوٓا۟ أَيْمَـٰنَكُمْ ۚ كَذَٰلِكَ يُبَيِّنُ ٱللَّهُ لَكُمْ ءَايَـٰتِهِۦ لَعَلَّكُمْ تَشْكُرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God does not take you [to task] for what is thoughtless in your oaths, only for your binding oaths: the atonement for breaking an oath is to feed ten poor people with food equivalent to what you would normally give your own families, or to clothe them, or to set free a slave- if a person cannot find the means, he should fast for three days. This is the atonement for breaking your oaths- keep your oaths. In this way God makes clear His revelations to you, so that you may be thankful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يُؤَاخِذُكُمُ","en_gloss":"will call you to account","transliteration":"yuākhidhukumu","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِٱللَّغْوِ","en_gloss":"for the thoughtless utterances","transliteration":"bil-laghwi","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِىٓ","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَيْمَـٰنِكُمْ","en_gloss":"your oaths","transliteration":"aymānikum","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِن","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"walākin","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يُؤَاخِذُكُم","en_gloss":"He will call you to account","transliteration":"yuākhidhukum","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"for what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَقَّدتُّمُ","en_gloss":"you contracted","transliteration":"ʿaqqadttumu","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْأَيْمَـٰنَ ۖ","en_gloss":"(of) the oath","transliteration":"l-aymāna","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فَكَفَّـٰرَتُهُۥٓ","en_gloss":"So its expiation","transliteration":"fakaffāratuhu","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":13,"ar":"إِطْعَامُ","en_gloss":"(is) feeding","transliteration":"iṭ'ʿāmu","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عَشَرَةِ","en_gloss":"(of) ten","transliteration":"ʿasharati","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مَسَـٰكِينَ","en_gloss":"needy people","transliteration":"masākīna","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":16,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":17,"ar":"أَوْسَطِ","en_gloss":"average","transliteration":"awsaṭi","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":18,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"(of) what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":19,"ar":"تُطْعِمُونَ","en_gloss":"you feed","transliteration":"tuṭ'ʿimūna","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":20,"ar":"أَهْلِيكُمْ","en_gloss":"your families","transliteration":"ahlīkum","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":21,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":22,"ar":"كِسْوَتُهُمْ","en_gloss":"clothing them","transliteration":"kis'watuhum","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":23,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":24,"ar":"تَحْرِيرُ","en_gloss":"freeing","transliteration":"taḥrīru","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":25,"ar":"رَقَبَةٍۢ ۖ","en_gloss":"a slave","transliteration":"raqabatin","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":26,"ar":"فَمَن","en_gloss":"But whoever","transliteration":"faman","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":27,"ar":"لَّمْ","en_gloss":"(does) not","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":28,"ar":"يَجِدْ","en_gloss":"find","transliteration":"yajid","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":29,"ar":"فَصِيَامُ","en_gloss":"(that), then fasting","transliteration":"faṣiyāmu","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":30,"ar":"ثَلَـٰثَةِ","en_gloss":"(for) three","transliteration":"thalāthati","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":31,"ar":"أَيَّامٍۢ ۚ","en_gloss":"days","transliteration":"ayyāmin","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":32,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"That","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":33,"ar":"كَفَّـٰرَةُ","en_gloss":"(is the) expiation","transliteration":"kaffāratu","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":34,"ar":"أَيْمَـٰنِكُمْ","en_gloss":"(of) your oaths","transliteration":"aymānikum","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":35,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":36,"ar":"حَلَفْتُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"you have sworn","transliteration":"ḥalaftum","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":37,"ar":"وَٱحْفَظُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"And guard","transliteration":"wa-iḥ'faẓū","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":38,"ar":"أَيْمَـٰنَكُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"your oaths","transliteration":"aymānakum","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":39,"ar":"كَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"Thus","transliteration":"kadhālika","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":40,"ar":"يُبَيِّنُ","en_gloss":"makes clear","transliteration":"yubayyinu","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":41,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":42,"ar":"لَكُمْ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":43,"ar":"ءَايَـٰتِهِۦ","en_gloss":"His Verses","transliteration":"āyātihi","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":44,"ar":"لَعَلَّكُمْ","en_gloss":"so that you may","transliteration":"laʿallakum","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":45,"ar":"تَشْكُرُونَ","en_gloss":"(be) grateful","transliteration":"tashkurūna","verse_key":"5:89"},{"pos":46,"ar":"٨٩","en_gloss":"(89)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"5:89"}]},{"verse_key":"5:90","surah":5,"ayah":90,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوٓا۟ إِنَّمَا ٱلْخَمْرُ وَٱلْمَيْسِرُ وَٱلْأَنصَابُ وَٱلْأَزْلَـٰمُ رِجْسٌ مِّنْ عَمَلِ ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنِ فَٱجْتَنِبُوهُ لَعَلَّكُمْ تُفْلِحُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"You who believe, intoxicants and gambling, idolatrous practices, and [divining with] arrows are repugnant acts- Satan’s doing- shun them so that you may prosper.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O you","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"5:90"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"5:90"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"5:90"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"Verily","transliteration":"innamā","verse_key":"5:90"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْخَمْرُ","en_gloss":"the intoxicants","transliteration":"l-khamru","verse_key":"5:90"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٱلْمَيْسِرُ","en_gloss":"and [the] games of chance","transliteration":"wal-maysiru","verse_key":"5:90"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَٱلْأَنصَابُ","en_gloss":"and (sacrifices at) altars","transliteration":"wal-anṣābu","verse_key":"5:90"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَٱلْأَزْلَـٰمُ","en_gloss":"and divining arrows","transliteration":"wal-azlāmu","verse_key":"5:90"},{"pos":9,"ar":"رِجْسٌۭ","en_gloss":"(are an) abomination","transliteration":"rij'sun","verse_key":"5:90"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِّنْ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"5:90"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَمَلِ","en_gloss":"(the) work","transliteration":"ʿamali","verse_key":"5:90"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Shaitaan","transliteration":"l-shayṭāni","verse_key":"5:90"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فَٱجْتَنِبُوهُ","en_gloss":"so avoid it","transliteration":"fa-ij'tanibūhu","verse_key":"5:90"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لَعَلَّكُمْ","en_gloss":"so that you may","transliteration"